RipsReferral_CollectReferrerFee
├── when referrer is zero address
│   └── it should return zero.
├── when referrer has a custom fee set
│   ├── it should return fee based on custom fee percent.
│   └── it should not update referrer stats.
├── when no referral tiers are configured and base fee is zero
│   └── it should return zero.
├── when base fee is set and referrer has no prior activity
│   ├── it should accumulate ticket revenue into curr month volume.
│   └── it should return fee based on base fee percent.
├── when referrer current month volume crosses a tier threshold
│   ├── it should update next fee percent.
│   └── it should emit a {ReferrerStatsUpdated} event.
├── when referrer current month volume crosses multiple tier thresholds
│   └── it should set next fee percent to the highest reached tier.
├── when referrers previous month volume reached a tier threshold
│   └── it should return fee based on active fee percent.
├── when active fee percent is below base fee percent
│   └── it should return fee based on base fee percent.
├── when a new month starts after a consecutive active month
│   ├── it should promote next fee percent to active fee percent.
│   └── it should reset curr month volume.
└── when a new month starts after an inactive month gap
    ├── it should reset active fee percent to zero.
    └── it should reset curr month volume.
